{{!
    @template mod_rememberme/report_bands

    Band progression across the cohort.

    The reason column is the reason this report exists. A band reached by
    backstop means the learner never met the unlock threshold and the next part
    of the syllabus was handed to them anyway, to stop them stalling on one band
    for the whole course. That is a deliberate mercy, not an achievement, and it
    is the row a teacher should act on. It is shown as words rather than as a
    colour, so it survives a greyscale print and a screen reader.

    The learner value arrives already escaped with s() and is rendered
    unescaped on purpose. Every other value is escaped by the template engine.

    Context variables required for this template:
    * hasrows Boolean Whether there are any participants to list
    * bandcount Number How many bands this activity has
    * hasbackstopped Boolean Whether anybody advanced by backstop
    * backstopped Number How many learners advanced by backstop
    * rows Array of rows, each with:
        * learner String The learner's full name, already escaped
        * bandlevel Number The band the learner has reached
        * started Boolean Whether the learner has any band state at all
        * reason String The localised label for how the band was reached
        * isbackstop Boolean Whether that reason was the backstop
        * bandsince String Formatted date the learner entered this band
        * firstsession String Formatted date of the learner's first session

    Example context (json):
    {
        "hasrows": true,
        "bandcount": 6,
        "hasbackstopped": true,
        "backstopped": 2,
        "rows": [
            {
                "learner": "Aisha Karim",
                "bandlevel": 4,
                "started": true,
                "reason": "Band established",
                "isbackstop": false,
                "bandsince": "18/08/26",
                "firstsession": "02/06/26"
            },
            {
                "learner": "Tom Boyd",
                "bandlevel": 2,
                "started": true,
                "reason": "Backstop",
                "isbackstop": true,
                "bandsince": "20/08/26",
                "firstsession": "05/06/26"
            }
        ]
    }
}}
<div class="mod_rememberme-report mod_rememberme-report-bands">
    {{#hasbackstopped}}
        <div class="alert alert-warning" role="status">
            {{#str}}backstopwarning, mod_rememberme, {{backstopped}}{{/str}}
        </div>
    {{/hasbackstopped}}

    {{#hasrows}}
    <div class="table-responsive">
        <table class="table table-striped generaltable">
            <caption>{{#str}}reportbandscaption, mod_rememberme{{/str}}</caption>
            <thead>
                <tr>
                    <th scope="col">{{#str}}learner, mod_rememberme{{/str}}</th>
                    <th scope="col">{{#str}}bandprogress, mod_rememberme{{/str}}</th>
                    <th scope="col">{{#str}}bandreason, mod_rememberme{{/str}}</th>
                    <th scope="col">{{#str}}bandsince, mod_rememberme{{/str}}</th>
                    <th scope="col">{{#str}}firstsession, mod_rememberme{{/str}}</th>
                </tr>
            </thead>
            <tbody>
                {{#rows}}
                <tr>
                    <th scope="row" class="font-weight-normal">{{{learner}}}</th>
                    <td>
                        {{#started}}{{bandlevel}} / {{bandcount}}{{/started}}
                        {{^started}}{{#str}}notstarted, mod_rememberme{{/str}}{{/started}}
                    </td>
                    <td>
                        {{reason}}
                        {{#isbackstop}}
                            <span class="badge badge-warning bg-warning text-dark ms-1">{{#str}}flagreview, mod_rememberme{{/str}}</span>
                        {{/isbackstop}}
                    </td>
                    <td>{{bandsince}}</td>
                    <td>{{firstsession}}</td>
                </tr>
                {{/rows}}
            </tbody>
        </table>
    </div>
    {{/hasrows}}
    {{^hasrows}}
        <p class="text-muted">{{#str}}reportnodata, mod_rememberme{{/str}}</p>
    {{/hasrows}}
</div>
